--- IF LOGGING INTO THE SERVER BEFORE YOU DO ANYTHING RUN THIS!!!! ---

`source .venv/bin/activate`

You have to run this in order to set up the python virtual enviorment. You can't run any of the below commands without running this first!

--- GIT ---

Use git to checkout branches and download source! Git is already connected to the repo with a shared account!

--- BUILDING ---

Build source with this commmand:

`./build.sh`
(when building don't forget to generate secerets if needed or change the permissions in the docker file)

--- FLASHING ---

Flash source to board with this command!

`python3 flash_firmware_board1.py` <-- flash board connected to /dev/ttyACM0
`python3 flash_firmware_board2.py` <-- flash board connected to /dev/ttyACM2

If ANYTHING breaks ping Cole on discord!!!

--- NOTES ---

Board 1 == /dev/ttyACM0
Board 2 == /dev/ttyACM2

Example Commands:
uvx ectf tools /dev/ttyACM0 list 1234
uvx ectf tools /dev/ttyACM2 list 1234
